<title>POLAND: KOMPAP OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>KOMPAP OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.21 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.36 vs   0.29</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.39 vs   0.33</p>
<p> Sales		    4.68 vs   3.19</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.61 vs   2.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.35 vs   3.98</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.69 vs   4.39</p>
<p> Sales		   35.49 vs  26.79</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paper maker is Kompap SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
